            <div xml:id="m-728550b7-c4f1-4129-8693-d7b192a5dee0">
              <lg xml:id="m-02593595-cfd4-4025-b4da-3ad5c4cb4217">
                <l xml:id="m-b1b80ee1-54b1-458a-ac0f-b31017d4ea4c" facs="#m-410fa39e-6711-4268-bd85-7bf03b0033fb" label="text-like">loth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-49470860-9660-4367-aa63-7c6c71e1edd1" facs="#m-39b811ba-2c60-443b-8629-aba14b07fb4b" label="ambiguous">108o</l><l xml:id="m-7cff2cc3-beac-4c22-b013-0bc0ee206d88" facs="#m-e3ed0d38-7b42-4981-926c-b65aad394fda" label="lyrics-like">stram in vérba ó-ris mé-i. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-6a1d47ee-e820-4612-9cb2-41aa724c7ed9" facs="#m-a3c32f9d-f9d2-4519-a937-5a80360a9cf7" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e3450d49-1a93-4d5f-a40c-561b50e45c70" facs="#m-2e7a8331-24ac-4751-84c4-b07e47ad52a1" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens et miséricors Deus,l pore páriter expedíti, *quae tua</l><l xml:id="m-f1dc727a-fa98-4272-befd-1bbb1ab73fd4" facs="#m-4859ec30-6ad4-48ea-aded-3829114f67a4" label="lyrics-like">Uunivérsa nobis adversántia pro-] sunt, liberis méntibus exsequámur.</l><l xml:id="m-a6eeba89-c7ec-454b-aaa5-345d1fec5916" facs="#m-3e5a2c3c-e629-4542-bfbe-2c0a52827ade" label="lyrics-like">pitiátus exclúde: t ut mente et cór-l Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-250a2b3d-82f3-4f0a-bc98-991f6479e556" facs="#m-a9622dc4-56ca-45e2-8890-4625dd9cbba5" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-279e20b3-da84-49b2-8e12-09efcc749e87" facs="#m-eab199a5-c389-48f3-8e62-d7fc43b0c6d2" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Ephesios. Ephes. 4. e.</l><l xml:id="m-dc180ca2-645a-40d8-8d72-093234b10a41" facs="#m-2af3b9c7-2d80-4220-be2e-4da1075e6b1c" label="lyrics-like">VRatres: Renovámini spiritu] Irascímini, et nolîte peccáre: sol</l><l xml:id="m-1f8b79fc-1ae4-40a5-abd6-5b21662d1abf" facs="#m-656942bd-aaef-4eae-bc1d-69b076ccad2a" label="lyrics-like">mentis vestrae, et indúite no¬</l><l xml:id="m-5afe206b-ec73-4f89-9ea0-cd08b30c61a7" facs="#m-9ce24144-cbc7-4e8f-9391-d2eeb3869f9f" label="lyrics-like">non óccidat super iracúndiam ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-d845543b-3ee4-4ec9-9459-478d68b27619" facs="#m-69db1ce2-9d57-4cc8-810a-83e05ead50e9" label="lyrics-like">stram. Nolite locum dare diábolo:</l><l xml:id="m-f0e88b58-45f5-4ce2-8e33-b1ba9e71f0d6" facs="#m-d83ff2b3-07c6-4d43-8cf1-e2e5884dc2c0" label="lyrics-like">vum hóminem, qui secúndum Deum</l><l xml:id="m-f5784357-e6eb-439c-9417-06efc7277b2b" facs="#m-1d6a8208-ae61-482c-b03b-992babf207f3" label="lyrics-like">creátus est in justítia, et sanctitáte</l><l xml:id="m-d9ad36a6-2160-4700-b426-72fef1f270da" facs="#m-984fb865-3f3c-4dc8-a4c9-7b4664f7f8b2" label="lyrics-like">qui furabátur, jam non furétur; ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-882257a0-ae99-497b-b048-642e7baad9a3" facs="#m-574e9df2-ce2b-4039-87f6-ebe07fc10eb3" label="lyrics-like">veritátis. Propter quod deponéntes</l><l xml:id="m-49735ff1-732e-4e54-af02-bb58dd1709c0" facs="#m-eef3d15e-812b-4bf9-9f1a-89d656c9cd90" label="lyrics-like">gis autem labóret, operándo máni¬</l><l xml:id="m-2699c7dc-ccf4-470c-acbe-b61e2ed28c88" facs="#m-d76e8d5e-a9c3-4448-8c64-557e5ecee2ab" label="lyrics-like">mendácium, loquímini veritátem</l><l xml:id="m-cf8e7b60-9c0b-4eb6-8b94-20b3ef3258e3" facs="#m-08d8be88-f566-4d12-84bb-a77b94141b8f" label="lyrics-like">bus suis, quod bonum est, ut hábeat</l><l xml:id="m-f61f7c84-5eaf-4c86-8a8d-c12ee0948b0b" facs="#m-0954059e-885c-4177-a6c7-f29d81a73715" label="lyrics-like">unde tribuat necessitátem patiénti.</l><l xml:id="m-90678533-3ab1-491f-bb12-e01e9b170023" facs="#m-19abda8e-8665-4a0a-88f1-adf3560f1670" label="lyrics-like">unusquísque cum próximo suo</l><l xml:id="m-6d635d6c-24bd-479d-b06d-9f4198110a88" facs="#m-a1e667d5-73d1-434c-96df-a27520703202" label="lyrics-like">quóniam sumus invicem membra.</l><l xml:id="m-07a90512-72f8-4505-951b-ada66b854d1e" facs="#m-1ec5c106-3d1c-4dae-bbbb-a0cd985156e7" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-d291cfe0-8c73-4789-9d3b-d8d86f8c1d8e" facs="#m-72c531ac-1c39-4d97-b3f8-629905974008" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-74021235-647e-4103-8a30-512d33e553cc" facs="#m-accc8181-40d2-46a7-8fb9-030c43cc9588" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-d82b9aa4-5ccf-4fe0-931c-4742d12ae458" facs="#m-5aa4de8e-97ae-4e67-92b3-242ae679d1a8" label="lyrics-like">Lrigá-tur</l><l xml:id="m-0f3aac34-52fc-4dc6-8db4-4427cd7769cb" facs="#m-ac58795c-f080-4e21-9680-fc124f5e7a15" label="ambiguous">sicut in¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b9740c1-51af-471f-ba78-2980011cafc3" facs="#m-e83cd7f0-6a62-428a-b16b-b01b3565b5c8" label="lyrics-like">orá- ti-o mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f9f8e08-39c9-41a7-b1cd-a673463c2f83" facs="#m-f2921043-6406-499a-8578-c5c47f780629" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-cca830c2-55bc-4100-ae8e-c753b8466611" facs="#m-de6ddef3-7de1-48ca-907d-ef5661f34050" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mine.</l><l xml:id="m-42ca09ec-b1cc-46e4-bbfd-a5f21172569a" facs="#m-8f7b0ed1-2cca-4965-bd5e-ba86a9a2a19a" label="lyrics-like">in conspéctu tú¬ </l><l xml:id="m-8a830e5b-8e81-4ce6-9d45-f7672b8f103b" facs="#m-72459fa3-d1cd-4e07-90c3-db9aa35430f4" label="lyrics-like">cénsum</l><l xml:id="m-ec6e8571-ee8b-43ca-92e0-223d95bcd47e" facs="#m-b76bacd4-93bd-4755-a795-677740d810b9" label="lyrics-like">V. Elevá¬</l><l xml:id="m-e513ee1b-2b80-4a71-abbe-9f642990ac39" facs="#m-b4189b21-8c98-4cc5-ac46-17414651b31d" label="ambiguous">ti-o</l><l xml:id="m-e07c147a-beae-49bb-a958-c5b3d1a2fee5" facs="#m-afbcc346-8779-49ea-9de7-347a7945a579" label="lyrics-like">mánu-um</l><l xml:id="m-5b2d82f5-bc83-4546-a81d-d2b627ae3ddc" facs="#m-2f9d0ad6-30b7-4ff3-961e-6bd164ce9e31" label="lyrics-like">rum sacri-fí-ci¬ um</l><l xml:id="m-b4e5c06d-5d19-4d08-8ced-8ca7ec80357e" facs="#m-9ad16de3-a3c0-427e-8966-2df5b661c1c5" label="lyrics-like">me-á¬</l><l xml:id="m-d263a517-8cc4-469b-9b9e-7325953d076a" facs="#m-466b3ba3-afd9-4765-9145-e0886f6a96ea" label="lyrics-like">vesper-tí¬</l><l xml:id="m-476b62bf-c02b-4cae-a856-f3f28d6c4418" facs="#m-acd98726-531c-4444-85ea-6c1a3f3bd1e9" label="ambiguous">num.</l><l xml:id="m-afd2395e-3e16-4d47-af7e-82a2a42b36c5" facs="#m-ec7a3298-14aa-4b58-9f6a-36461e2d68df" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-33c85749-9774-427a-8cfa-7124a0c5d276" facs="#m-f2e48725-a524-4ebe-a42a-98e70a084254" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-1cd990c1-dd3e-4e47-a156-43ebd7eaf7c0" facs="#m-9db6ce35-71f3-49a0-a920-1657593dd121" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-5b2aaf25-471a-436b-a02c-9b7e32b6ee46" facs="#m-1c0162e5-f700-4098-85f9-6316c640d01e" label="lyrics-like">V. Confi- témi¬</l><l xml:id="m-65f076ca-2e0a-4b86-bacd-2c4cd33a794b" facs="#m-8a283f34-6959-489f-8451-73e93078fe63" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-826d6164-42fa-4500-a4e2-789aba454caa" facs="#m-97e7436c-87f6-46f6-b93a-f55d786ec38d" label="ambiguous">ij</l></lg>
